summary:
  A player standing in its own window with the popup shut is treated as hidden.

history:
  On screen is the open popup or the window that is up. Read as the popup
  alone, the window's titles, its clock and the volume it shows stop the
  moment the popup closes, which it does by itself when the window takes
  the keyboard.

target:
  package/contents/ui/WindowLogic.js

find:
      return popupOpen === true || windowUp === true;

replace:
      return popupOpen === true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_windowlogic.qml::test_the_face_is_on_screen_while_either_seat_is.
